<p>This policy explains what personal information Junk Away We Go Demolition Inc. ("we", "us") collects when you visit our website or contact us, how we use it, and the rights you have over it. We wrote it in plain language because nothing about privacy should be confusing.</p>

<h2>Who we are</h2>
<p>Junk Away We Go Demolition Inc.<br/>
13507 Calle Colina, Poway, CA 92064<br/>
Phone: <a href="tel:7604733973">760-473-3973</a><br/>
